# data_wsy/.gitignore
#
# This directory only commits "code + docs + final data"; intermediate artifacts and caches are always ignored.

# ---- Raw API response cache -------------------------------------------------
# _cache/ holds the raw JSON responses from BusinessQuant and SEC:
#   bq_*.json                     BusinessQuant revenue responses (cache hits use none of the 40/day quota)
#   sec_sub_*.json                SEC main submissions files
#   sec_CIK*-submissions-*.json   SEC historical archives (JPM alone has 70 files)
#   facts_*.json                  SEC companyfacts (one per company, with all us-gaap line items)
#   concept_*.json                SEC companyconcept (used by crosscheck_revenue.py)
#   firstfiled_*.json             earliest 10-K/10-Q filing dates per company
# These are all re-fetchable intermediate artifacts and large (hundreds of MB in total); do not commit them.
_cache/

# ---- Python bytecode --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ---- Transient log overwritten on every run ---------------------------------
fetch_log.txt

# ---- Local API key (in case it is read from a file later) -------------------
.env
bq_key.txt

# =============================================================================
# The following files **should be committed** (for documentation only; no rules needed):
#
#   Scripts (the whole project has only two Python entry points):
#     get_stock_data.py      data acquisition (prices / revenue / indices)
#     merge_revenue.py       revenue correction: fetch SEC -> choose line item -> derive Q4 -> fiscal quarter labels
#                            -> compare with BQ -> output -> self-check
#
#   Data:
#     prices_raw.csv         prices (28 stocks)
#     benchmark.csv          6 market indices
#     revenue.csv            raw BQ revenue (with known errors, for reference only)
#     revenue_adjusted.csv   ★ corrected revenue; use this one for backtests
#     revenue_merge_report.csv   chosen line item + per-period replacement details + Q4 comparison
#
#   Docs and caches:
#     README_wsy.md          this directory's README
#     .gitignore             this file
#     _sec_ticker_map.json   SEC ticker→CIK mapping (874 KB, committed with the code
#                            to avoid re-downloading after every clone)
# =============================================================================
